;    1: TDecorate(count=20, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=30, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=7164, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=19, unk2=65280, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=つ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=こうこつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=ききょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=162, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=はる, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=と, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=こうかつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=つばき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=つ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=しゅっぽん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=たけ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=とうかん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=うの, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=つな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   19: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=いしずえ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=9230, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=8626, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The remaining item to look into: the ecology of <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But before that...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In front of me is Arata's scripture, 'The Teachings of Cerejeira,' brought up from the basement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't looked at it since I was a child, but even rereading the passages that come to mind, I can't make much sense of it.<PG>
In short, it describes the disaster Ginosuke Niimura lived through in his mother country.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A trumpet sounds and the dead rise, cataclysms strike and people and the world come to an end―that sort of story.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, it's a story from ancient times, so I can't imagine all of it has to do with the curse-killings.<PG>
But these days, it seems, it has been observed many times around the world, under the name of the apocalyptic sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yet for all that ringing, far from humanity being wiped out, there's no sign of the dead coming back to life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet, the fact that <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE> brought up the apocalyptic sound anyway―
{PAUSE ""}
does it mean she has something in mind?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Come to think of it, I still haven't read the translation from <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\携帯茅萱入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Anyway, I'd better check this as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\醍醐の花見絵画.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">'The Fierce Sound and the Green-Eye Curse-Killing'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In Shiyo 340, a grand cherry-blossom viewing was held by </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, they say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But the purpose of that cherry-blossom viewing was not merely to show off his power to the most exalted people in the land.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The reason one can say so is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> carried off several of the Arata settlement's cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The late Westerner Ginosuke Niimura, to test the effect of Droga, had given about ten doses of Droga to a certain traveling samurai, it is said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\太閤殿下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">That traveling samurai was none other than </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> used the power of Droga to rule this realm.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But he was not blessed with heirs, and the heir he was at last granted was still young.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As things stood, the heir would be dragged into a fight over the succession.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> tried to bestow Droga on his heir and make </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s regime unshakable.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That cherry-blossom viewing was a pretext for carrying off the cherry trees here.</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s scheme, it seems, failed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> died a few months after the cherry-blossom viewing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The Arata cherry must be, after all, a variety that cannot grow anywhere but here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Otherwise, there is no explaining why Droga exists only here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Well, whatever became of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s scheme, it is of no concern to us, the people of Arata.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "山火事.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Right around the time the cherry-blossom viewing was being held, many of the residents died in the Green-Eye Curse-Killing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It will take time once more to build back the prosperity of former days.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">However, after the war with those Westerners and the Green-Eye Curse-Killing, something even more inexplicable happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That war and the Green-Eye Curse-Killing had brought the residents from 100 down to about 50, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">After that, several more vanished.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">They vanished because of 'the Fierce Sound.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">On hearing that sound, all of them looked as though </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つ">possessed</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, their expressions </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こうこつ">rapt</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">One after another, they all said it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That they are happy to have become part of the Goddess.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That was all of the mail from <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It hardly touched on 'the Fierce Sound,' but <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE> must have drawn on every phenomenon she could imagine and offered the apocalyptic sound as an example.<PG>
But this alone still isn't enough material.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll send the next part to <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Oh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a sheet of paper tucked between the pages.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like an old note, but what could it be?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'From this point on, important matters are written down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I have translated it into today's words so that our descendants can read it a little more easily. Please, put it to use. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I do not have long now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Grand Witch　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> Niimura'</STYLE><PG>
Kikyo Niimura...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've heard of her―the Grand Witch two generations back, I think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, I won't need to trouble <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
Then, Kikyo-san, with thanks, I will read what you wrote.<PG>
This text seems to have been written in Shiyo 482.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In time, that's a full 140 years after the cherry-blossom viewing, the infighting and the mass disappearance just now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A description from this era is new to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">After the Fierce Sound, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> appeared.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\BGM_212.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\トミの母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">That was the true Goddess.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="はる">Long</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ago a girl had died, and yet she had become a bewitching flower and come again into this world.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Those who were </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="と">possessed</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> vanished then and there and became cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">A little way from the settlement, several cherry trees had sprung up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But these were no ordinary cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Those who had vanished had simply become cherry trees and sprung up anew where the cherry trees stood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As proof, their clothes were wound around the roots of the cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">The bewitching flower that descends in the month of death―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is filled with rage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Having lost </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> offshoot to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">His Highness</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who carried it off, she means to replace it by reincarnating us as new cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We know who will vanish and become cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Those who have used Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Anyone who has ever used Droga, or their children, will be enthralled by </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Those so enthralled turn into cherry trees and become a part of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">That was not all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\サクラ乱立\昔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">The Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―along with her, countless giant cherry trees sprang up, big enough to swallow the mountains.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The earth grew barren, the water dried up, and this land of Arata died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What was more, the dead overran that land.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Those clad in white robes tried to carry off the living.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Yes, it is the same calamity our ancestor, Lord Ginosuke, spoke of.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The hideous Fierce Sound, the earthquakes, the giant cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="こうかつ">cunning</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> dead, clad in white robes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Lord Ginosuke's teachings are no fairy tale. They are all true.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">We racked our brains and succeeded in driving off </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We sent the dead back to the underworld, destroyed the giant cherry trees, and brought the earth back to life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In doing so, we offered up as a sacrifice the young Grand Witch who had become green-eyed, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="つばき">Tsubaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Thanks to her sacrifice, we were able to destroy </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">However, there is no certainty that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was truly destroyed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Wielders of a mysterious power of curses, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">as long as Droga goes on existing, the next cherry trees may yet spring up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> who controls </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―unless they are utterly destroyed, there will be no peace here in Arata.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">People of Arata yet to come, our descendants.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Hand down faithfully to the generations after you what we now set forth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And when </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">the Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, appears, you must destroy it without fail.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'The dead come forth from the underworld, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Those who have become corpses also become bewitching flowers and come forth from the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Only the green-eyed prevail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Those who have become green-eyed wither the bewitching flowers and return the dead to the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The descendants shall without fail don blood-red garb, and resist.'</STYLE><PG>
