{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Until now, we of the Holy Cerejeira Church have tried to work out scientifically how Droga, the Church's sacred implement, works.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">However, we judged it unsuitable for use on the human body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The reason, needless to say, is that its side effects are severe.</STYLE><PG>
The Holy Cerejeira Church...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know the scripture called 'The Teachings of Cerejeira,' but this is the first I've heard the name of the Church.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the way this is written, a church called the Holy Cerejeira Church was carrying out research on Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked up the Holy Cerejeira Church on my phone.<PG>
Let's see... 
{PAUSE ""}
A local religion once practiced in Megasawa City, Iizawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Megasawa City prospered as a religious city, but lost its following rapidly in the Shiyo 730s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today only a handful of families of the faith remain.<PG>
I see―so there was a faith like that somewhere unconnected to Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe someone who <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="しゅっぽん">ran away</STYLE> from Arata founded it long ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It calls Droga a sacred implement, and the name Cerejeira connects too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, let me read on.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "豊岳桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
